{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Zero-Gravity 3D Billiards Set in Space</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash planets across the solar system and sink them into the black hole.<br>Experience a whole new kind of billiards where gravity is gone and space expands in all directions \u2014 a fusion of <strong>Zero-Gravity \u00d7 Space \u00d7 3D</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137000/extras/3c08ade8c4ea643a146f8b556b6c69e0.avif?t=1754407244\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Space Phenomena That Shape the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cosmic forces to your advantage:<br><strong>Heliopause</strong> launches planets forward on entry,<br><strong>Asteroids</strong> slow them down on impact,<br>and an expanding <strong>Black Hole</strong> reshapes the battlefield itself.<br>In this game, the universe decides your next move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137000/extras/b359141c187a437144c249307087c99f.avif?t=1754407244\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Multiple Rules &amp; Local Multiplayer up to 4 Players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a simple rule set where players compete to sink the most planets,<br>to a turn-based Nineball-style challenge \u2014 choose your rules and master the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports <strong>up to 4 players in local multiplayer</strong>.<br>Dive into the world of <strong>zero-gravity space billiards</strong> again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137000/extras/d5fb733f29a3c9ae6c004ebe164543c2.avif?t=1754407244\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Stream</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PlanetStrike fully supports all players as recorders of the cosmos.<br>Feel free to stream, upload, and monetize gameplay on platforms like YouTube, Twitch, or anywhere else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need for advance permission.<br>Just strike, and let your moments echo across the stars.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ignition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3137000/4181112f540f18802ebc50a2f9d03c79578c452c.jpg"},{"name":"Trajectory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3137000/6c5b5f00b8b5eb93d202e291605e1f31ebc4f50b.jpg"},{"name":"Periapsis","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3137000/b4749063f18c69d63b7adef1475eefae72fd3a18.jpg"},{"name":"Aphelion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3137000/f87a1b78ae126319527fdcf80ea8e8520954f442.jpg"},{"name":"Supernova","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3137000/0487337673094d628f4edbdaead87aac07b70ae1.jpg"},{"name":"Event Horizon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3137000/c11534deb071c01306fd365386796838d67d11fd.jpg"},{"name":"Singularity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3137000/65b4adc5b495a1f3d23223557a5e31227accea74.jpg"},{"name":"Redshift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3137000/914c563962fec918fa27af7c0e19c1c43b643d17.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3137000?t=1754407244","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137000/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754407244","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137000/0966e908cab3814afc46b5ee83987bb31730dd94/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754407244","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137000/0966e908cab3814afc46b5ee83987bb31730dd94/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754407244","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Zero-Gravity 3D Billiards Set in Space</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash planets across the solar system and sink them into the black hole.<br>Experience a whole new kind of billiards where gravity is gone and space expands in all directions \u2014 a fusion of <strong>Zero-Gravity \u00d7 Space \u00d7 3D</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137000/extras/3c08ade8c4ea643a146f8b556b6c69e0.avif?t=1754407244\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Space Phenomena That Shape the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cosmic forces to your advantage:<br><strong>Heliopause</strong> launches planets forward on entry,<br><strong>Asteroids</strong> slow them down on impact,<br>and an expanding <strong>Black Hole</strong> reshapes the battlefield itself.<br>In this game, the universe decides your next move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137000/extras/b359141c187a437144c249307087c99f.avif?t=1754407244\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Multiple Rules &amp; Local Multiplayer up to 4 Players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a simple rule set where players compete to sink the most planets,<br>to a turn-based Nineball-style challenge \u2014 choose your rules and master the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports <strong>up to 4 players in local multiplayer</strong>.<br>Dive into the world of <strong>zero-gravity space billiards</strong> again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137000/extras/d5fb733f29a3c9ae6c004ebe164543c2.avif?t=1754407244\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Stream</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PlanetStrike fully supports all players as recorders of the cosmos.<br>Feel free to stream, upload, and monetize gameplay on platforms like YouTube, Twitch, or anywhere else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need for advance permission.<br>Just strike, and let your moments echo across the stars.</p>","developers":["DanboruStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137000/eb12aabf6a940c5d0487272bd9b10343d5076bd8/header.jpg?t=1754407244","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"d